@AGENTS.md

## Claude Code skills

Project-specific Claude skills live in `.claude/skills/`; Claude Code loads them when the work matches. Detailed conventions are documented there.

- `spring-boot-conventions` - module structure, layers, controller/service/DTO patterns
- `backend-feature-delivery` - contract-first backend feature delivery across OpenAPI, DTOs, services, persistence, and schema changes
- `testing-patterns` - JUnit Jupiter 6, MockK, unit vs integration test conventions
- `deployment` - worked examples for deploying the backend container (Azure Container Apps); the user and their agent own the cloud choice, the secrets and the deployment

## Backend Claude Commands

- `/add-endpoint` - add or evolve a backend API endpoint using the OpenAPI-first flow
- `/generate-clients` - regenerate API clients from the shared contract
